@SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5089

### List tickets (paginated, filterable)
GET {{SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

### Overdue tickets only
GET {{SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets?overdueOnly=true
Accept: application/json

### Get a single ticket with comments
GET {{SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Accept: application/json

### Create a ticket
POST {{SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Cannot access account",
  "description": "Customer is locked out after a password reset attempt.",
  "customerName": "Jane Doe",
  "customerEmail": "jane.doe@example.com",
  "priority": "High"
}

### Change status (dedicated endpoint)
PATCH {{SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "InProgress"
}

### Assign an agent
PATCH {{SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/assignment
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentId": 1
}

### Add a comment
POST {{SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorName": "Support Agent",
  "body": "Investigating now."
}

### List agents
GET {{SupportDesk.Api_HostAddress}}/api/agents
Accept: application/json
